  "source_bug": "Replacing an already-applied LRA source did not withdraw its previous bounds or clear a cached conflict. API scopes did not own source snapshots; suffix-only level withdrawal could retain interior discarded sources.",
  "outcome": "Correct LRA replacement/scopes/withdrawal and exact tentative real phase advice pass all native checks. Strict integer model eligibility remains. Independent source-state and model checks confirm the retained correctness fix. Formal13-case pilot restores51/59/131 with times47.027/7.585/37.272s to16.508/2.623/23.726s, but loses NRA144: baseline SAT56.834s versus candidate timeout. Verified solves7/6/13, no gains or wrong/invalid model. The full160 dispatcher rejects this pilot and creates no native experiment. No new PR or merge. Same-core diagnostic controls isolate dynamic candidate refresh and prior LRA lifecycle behavior; these never replace the original lost row. No protected-set or new original-C QCP execution.",
  "protected_sets_used": false
}
